{title: Vande Mataram}
{artist: Bankim Chandra Chatterjee National Anthem}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C]Vande mataram, [F]vande ma [C]taram,        [C]Vande mataram, [F]vande ma [C]taram
Suj [F]laam suflaam [C]malyaj sheetlam,        [C]Shasya shyamlam mataram
[F]vande ma [C]taram,        [C]Shubhra [G]jyotsana pulkit yaa [C]mini
[C]Phulla kusumita [F]drumadal sho [C]bhini,        [Dm]Suhasini [Gm]sumadhur bha [C]shini
[G]Sukhdam vardam [C]mataram,        [C]Vande mataram, [F]vande ma [C]taram
[C]Koti koti [G]kunth kal kal ninaad [C]karle,        [C]Koti bhuj [F]airdhut khar [C]karwale
[C]abalakeno maa eto bale,        [C]bahubaladhaarinim namaami tarinim
Vande mataram, vande mataram
